OL,5,G2300 Rig 45
OL,6,     FOne crew - one killer. Andrea
OL,7,     F(Catherine Walker), a damage
OL,8,     Fregulator from Benthos Oil, is
OL,9,     Fsent out to Rig 45 two days before
OL,10,     FChristmas to investigate a fatal
OL,11,     Faccident.
OL,12,G0000 Mr Selfridge
OL,13,     FHarry Selfridge is a businessman
OL,14,     Fwho comes to the United Kingdom
OL,15,     Fand uses his personality and
OL,16,     Fskills to climb the ladder of
OL,17,     Fcommercial success.
OL,18,G0100 Victoria
OL,19,     FVictoria ascends the British
OL,20,     Fthrone at the tender age of 18 and
OL,21,     Flater falls in love with Prince
OL,22,     FAlbert and gets married to him.
